Name":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔_移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"择善固执，邪魔避之。","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/06185648BED231000183136353336353939.mp3"},{"id":"06638648BED231000183631333434323931","heroId":"184","skinId":"459","skinName":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔_移动语音6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"这道刻痕乃过去一顽童所留。嗯，距今已有五百年了。","hasText":true,"duration":8.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/06638648BED231000183631333434323931.mp3"},{"id":"06090648BED221000183132333639363936","heroId":"184","skinId":"459","skinName":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔_大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"朗朗乾坤，岂容祸煞横行！","hasText":true,"duration":19.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/06090648BED221000183132333639363936.mp3"},{"id":"06061648BED221000183237373635383036","heroId":"184","skinId":"459","skinName":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔_移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"吾曾身化磐石，镇压此地邪物。","hasText":true,"duration":5.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/06061648BED221000183237373635383036.mp3"},{"id":"06439648BED221000183132303235363433","heroId":"184","skinId":"459","skinName":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔_大厅语音2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"绿苔枯荣，人间转瞬千年。","hasText":true,"duration":19.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/06439648BED221000183132303235363433.mp3"},{"id":"06324648BED221000183237333539393830","heroId":"184","skinId":"459","skinName":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔_大厅语音3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"除尽邪祟，守世间太平——吾毕生之愿。","hasText":true,"duration":19.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/06324648BED221000183237333539393830.mp3"},{"id":"0693864785BEB1000183331363139373839","heroId":"184","skinId":"459","skinName":"降魔","title":"墨子_降魔","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"墨子_降魔","hasText":false,"duration":152.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/184/0693864785BEB1000183331363139373839.mp3"}]